        "id": 71273,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-29T22:52:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I use \"plink\" for (usually) one point of damage just because...erm...I do. I can't really remember why that word. I've probably just seen it in many of the various computer games I've played over the last two-and-a-half-ish decades.</p>",
