        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-30T01:18:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, taking \"Legs\" as a particular character's nickname, there could technically be three (four, when the new promo card comes out) Legs in Sentinels ;). Actual centipedes, I believe, don't have a hundred legs - this came up on QI. I think the nearest was about 96 or something. Similarly millipedes don't have a thousand legs ;).</p>",
